rch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 [540]}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0       out there at the boundary of the world,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0       no one would talk about you. And great fame}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0       I\uc1 \u8217 ?d sooner have than houses filled with gold}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0       or the power to sing sweet melodies,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0       sweeter than all the songs of Orpheus.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0       That\uc1 \u8217 ?s my response to you about my labours.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lan